---
id: classify
harpoon: "1.0"
name: Sentiment Classifier
description: Classifies message sentiment

# Prompt-first workflow: this is the entry point with conditional branching
entrypoint: true
next:
  - prompt: prompts/respond_positive.prompt
    condition: "sentiment == 'positive'"
  - prompt: prompts/respond_negative.prompt
    condition: "sentiment == 'negative'"
  - prompt: prompts/respond_neutral.prompt  # Default (no condition)

input:
  message:
    type: string
    required: true

output:
  format: json
  schema:
    sentiment:
      type: string
      description: One of "positive", "negative", or "neutral"
    message:
      type: string
      description: The original message (passed through)
---
Classify the sentiment of this message as "positive", "negative", or "neutral".

Message: {{ message }}

Return JSON with:
- sentiment: exactly one of "positive", "negative", or "neutral"
- message: the original message unchanged
